{"t": "2026-08-11T06:15:11.614760+00:00", "role": "atlas", "text": "Hey boss. What can I do for you?"}
{"t": "2026-08-11T06:15:33.880315+00:00", "role": "user", "text": "Mister Bruno."}
{"t": "2026-08-11T06:15:35.554559+00:00", "role": "user", "text": "get back to you."}
{"t": "2026-08-11T06:15:37.951142+00:00", "role": "user", "text": "Don't touch it."}
{"t": "2026-08-11T06:16:16.541689+00:00", "role": "user", "text": "Speakers"}
{"t": "2026-08-11T06:16:21.014242+00:00", "role": "user", "text": "Oh, no."}
{"t": "2026-08-11T06:16:31.079819+00:00", "role": "user", "text": "That's annoying."}
{"t": "2026-08-11T06:16:46.111697+00:00", "role": "user", "text": "Do not start the attack until the city is taken. Slay the war."}
{"t": "2026-08-11T06:16:49.963525+00:00", "role": "user", "text": "One of them was it."}
{"t": "2026-08-11T06:16:55.616916+00:00", "role": "user", "text": "I will break him."}
{"t": "2026-08-11T06:17:02.946753+00:00", "role": "user", "text": "What else I have done is find it. Baroque Hansa Army, come."}
{"t": "2026-08-11T06:17:04.063588+00:00", "role": "user", "text": "Friendly."}
{"t": "2026-08-11T06:17:08.937466+00:00", "role": "user", "text": "Cottage is the best defense that you have now."}
{"t": "2026-08-11T06:17:14.095902+00:00", "role": "atlas", "text": "Okay, sleeping. Wake me when you need something."}
